<title>ITALY: Genoa airport sees cargo volumes increase 3.7pct.</title>
<headline>Genoa airport sees cargo volumes increase 3.7pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genoa Cristoforo Colombo Airport has seen cargo traffic increase by 3.7 percent to 2.8 million kg, for the first seven months of the year, a Genoa airport spokesman said.</p>
<p>Mail traffic was up 20.6 percent to 1.5 million kg, he added.</p>
<p>-Air Cargo Newsroom tel:+44 171 542 7706 fax:+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
